<title>USA: San Diego Cty COPs repriced, top yield 5.60 pct.</title>
<headline>San Diego Cty COPs repriced, top yield 5.60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said Tuesday it repriced San Diego County's $37.7 million certificates of participation issue. The top yield was 5.60 percent in 2019.</p>
<p>COUNTY OF SAN DIEGO</p>
<p>RE: $37,690,000*</p>
<p>CERTIFICATES OF PARTICIPATION</p>
<p>(1996 NORTH COUNTY REGIONAL CENTER EXPANSION AND</p>
<p>EAST COUNTY COURTHOUSE DETENTION FACILITY</p>
<p>CONVERSION)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 12/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 05/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 11/15</p>
